comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-16T12:30:22.924Z","harness:codex","text=Duplicate-check evidence: searched the complete 2509-item all-status corpus through pm search for context intent calibration update package script and recovery command, then checked exact tracker text for context:intent:calibrate. Existing pm-3crymx owns truthful context results, pm-hid9g1 owns calibration, and pm-k6t4yb owns gate inventory; none owns the missing executable recovery spelling. Created as open follow-up and deliberately left unclaimed because this tranche does not edit that surface."
